From 7032e1e80f928a2c565e205b14dfbbcedb23df7c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 01:08:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] v1.40 part 3 of 3: eleven new pages, the property lookup
 tool, and live homes strips

Batch 2026-11-d in Blog-Brain, chosen from DataForSEO search volumes (about 60,000 searches a month
for Horry County records): research, an independent fact check, build, review, fix, and the owner's
round 2 on the preview (2026-11-14).

- /buyers/property-records/: one box that looks up any Horry County address live in the browser, from
  the county's and FEMA's public map services: parcel number, acres, town, zoning, flood zone,
  evacuation zone, buttons to the deed, tax bill and parcel map, and the homes for sale within a mile.
  No owner names. Tests: data/2026-11-d/property-records/lookup-test.js (--live asks each service).
- /buyers/property-records/deeds/, /gis-map/, /tax-bill/, /buyers/flood-zone-check/, /buyers/land/,
  /buyers/senior-living/, /hoa/fees-by-neighborhood/, /buyers/relocating/myrtle-beach-vs-charleston/,
  /submarkets/myrtle-beach/plantation-point/, /invest/condo-buildings/palace-resort/.
- Owner, 2026-11-14: "show them the houses". A feed at the top of each new page (idx-lib/feeds.js), and
  live strips in the pages for any search (glass homesQ, filled from /homes/api/strip): one per row of
  the land chart, per town, per community. /homes/api/strip keeps a lot-size ceiling (lotMax), with a test.
  Every community on the HOA fee table links to the search for it.
- Menu: property records lookup, flood zone check, HOA fees by neighborhood. Links in from 50 pages.
  Sitemap, llms.txt, llms-full, share images, dates.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
