height="3" rx="1" fill="#5c6b78"/><path d="M155 112q-12 6 -24 18" fill="none" stroke="#ede5d8" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><ellipse cx="84" cy="152" rx="52" ry="3" fill="#80b1bc"/><path d="M30 124H134L126 146Q120 150 110 150H52Q40 150 34 140Z" fill="#fbf8f2"/><path d="M33 130H133L131 136H36Z" fill="#c4783a"/><rect x="80" y="108" width="22" height="16" rx="2" fill="#2a3040"/><rect x="84" y="111" width="14" height="6" rx="1" fill="#c6e0e3"/><path d="M76 104H110M90 104V96" fill="none" stroke="#1c2028" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><rect x="52" y="116" width="16" height="8" rx="2" fill="#ede5d8"/><rect x="114" y="118" width="12" height="6" rx="2" fill="#ede5d8"/><rect x="14" y="64" width="4" height="36" fill="#2a3040"/><rect x="8" y="56" width="16" height="12" rx="1" fill="#6f8f5f"/><path d="M10 100h12" fill="none" stroke="#c6e0e3" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><strong>Boat dock</strong><span class="c3ph-t">Tie up your boat on the waterway from dawn to dusk</span></li></ul><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Outside there is a fire pit, and a lifestyle director plans activities for the neighborhood.</p><div class="c3-aerial c3-aerial-close"><figure class="c3ph-hero" style=""><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/55-plus/del-webb-grande-dunes/del-webb-grande-dunes-clubhouse-from-above-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/55-plus/del-webb-grande-dunes/del-webb-grande-dunes-clubhouse-from-above-600w.webp 600w, /images/55-plus/del-webb-grande-dunes/del-webb-grande-dunes-clubhouse-from-above-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1136px" width="1200" height="900" alt="The Del Webb at Grande Dunes clubhouse from above, with its large outdoor pool, parking, courts and a pond beside it, and the entrance marked" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="U.S. government aerial photo. License: Public domain" title="License: Public domain">U.S. government aerial photo</a></span></div><figcaption>The clubhouse, its outdoor pool and the courts, from above.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="what-is-the-grande-dunes-ocean-club"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="The Ocean Club">What is the Grande Dunes Ocean Club?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The <a href="https://www.grandedunesoceanclub.com/homeownership" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Grande Dunes Ocean Club</a> is the beach club for all of Grande Dunes, about 8 minutes by car from the Del Webb clubhouse. Your HOA fee includes your membership.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Grande Dunes is a large area of neighborhoods and golf courses in Myrtle Beach. Del Webb is one neighborhood inside it.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The Ocean Club has clubs for mahjong, knitting and Mexican Train, a dominoes game.</p><ul role="list" style="list-style:none;margin:1.2rem 0 1.6rem;padding:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(13rem,1fr));gap:.75rem;max-width:760px"><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 10a9 7 0 0 1 18 0zM12 10v10M2 21c3-1.5 6-1.5 10 0s7 1.5 10 0"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Private beach access</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">A members-only way onto the sand</span></li><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M9 15V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2M15 15V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2M9 7h6M9 11h6M2 18c1.7 1.2 3.3 1.2 5 0s3.3-1.2 5 0 3.3 1.2 5 0 3.3-1.2 5 0M2 21.5c1.7 1.2 3.3 1.2 5 0s3.3-1.2 5 0 3.3 1.2 5 0 3.3-1.2 5 0"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Pool and hot tub</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">A large outdoor pool at the beach club</span></li><li style="background:var(--ivory-2);border-top:3px solid var(--brass);padding:.9rem .85rem 1rem;margin:0"><span style="display:flex;width:2.6rem;height:2.6rem;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--brass-ink);align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:.6rem"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 5h16a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v14a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1zM3 10h18M8 3v4M16 3v4M8 14h.01M12 14h.01M16 14h.01M8 17.5h.01M12 17.5h.01"/></svg></span><strong style="display:block;color:var(--navy);font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:.25rem">Classes and events</strong><span style="display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.5">Clubs, classes and events for members. Some cost extra.</span></li></ul></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="where-is-del-webb-at-grande-dunes"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Where it is">Where is Del Webb at Grande Dunes?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Del Webb at Grande Dunes is inside the city of Myrtle Beach, on the ocean side of the Intracoastal Waterway. In our experience, rush hour adds 5 to 10 minutes to the drive times below.</p><figure style="margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:760px"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="c3r-del-webb-at-grande-dunes" viewBox="0 0 360 341" width="360" height="341" role="img" aria-label="Del Webb at Grande Dunes is in Myrtle Beach, about 4 minutes from the beach. The map also shows Grand Strand Medical Center, about 6 minutes away; and Myrtle Beach International Airport, about 20 minutes away." style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:760px;background:#f7f3ec;border:1px solid rgba(28,32,40,.15)"><style>#c3r-del-webb-at-grande-dunes text{font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#f7f3ec;stroke-width:3px;stroke-linejoin:round;fill:#1c2028}#c3r-del-webb-at-grande-dunes .h{font:500 17px 'Fraunces',Georgia,serif}#c3r-del-webb-at-grande-dunes .l{font-size:14px;font-weight:500}#c3r-del-webb-at-grande-dunes .m{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;fill:#91592b}#c3r-del-webb-at-grande-dunes .t{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.1em;fill:#5c6b78}#c3r-del-webb-at-grande-dunes .T{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;lett