p" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Talk to us about a home in Myrtle Trace.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">Call about the home you like. One of our agents will go over the HOA's rules and the costs with you. Office hours are Monday to Friday 9 to 6 and Saturday 10 to 4.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="tel:+18543332135">Call an agent</a></div></section></main>
