ection><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Send us an address before you offer.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">We pull its flood zone, an insurance quote, the tax at both rates and, for a condo, the HOA papers and rental rules.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/?topic=buying-in-myrtle-beach-end">Send us an address</a></div></section></main>
