+<main id="main"><div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/buyers/">Buyers</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Flood Zone Check</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Buying a home</p><h1 class="detail-h1">How to check if a Horry County house is in a flood zone<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">Look it up on FEMA's map before you make an offer.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 14, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Of Horry County homes for sale in FEMA's high-risk flood zone, about 4 in 5 did not come up in this site's home search filtered for flood zone.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">If the address is in zone A, AE or VE on FEMA's flood map, the house is in the high-risk flood zone. A mortgage from a bank there needs flood insurance.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">To see the zone, type the address into our free <a href="/buyers/property-records/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">property records search</a>. It is also on FEMA's <a href="https://msc.fema.gov/portal/home" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Flood Map Service Center</a>, the official public source for flood maps.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Do not count on a search filter. We check FEMA's map for every house you send us.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Send us the address of a house you like. We find its flood zone.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Have us find the zone</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="home-search"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3">Does a home search show the flood zone?</h2><style id="c3-glass">main#main{--g-ink:#8a5226;--g-ink-lg:#a8612c;--g-edge:rgba(255,255,255,.8);--g-hi:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.95);--g-sh:0 1px 2px rgba(28,32,40,.05),0 14px 36px -20px rgba(28,32,40,.3);--g-r:20px;--g-blur:saturate(150%) blur(16px);background-color:#f8f4ee;background-image:radial-gradient(44rem 26rem at 4% 460px,rgba(232,201,154,.30),rgba(232,201,154,0) 70%),radial-gradient(40rem 26rem at 98% 1000px,rgba(196,120,58,.08),rgba(196,120,58,0) 70%),radial-gradient(46rem 26rem at 16% 1500px,rgba(232,201,154,.22),rgba(232,201,154,0) 70%),radial-gradient(40rem 24rem at 94% 1960px,rgba(42,48,64,.045),rgba(42,48,64,0) 70%);background-size:100% 2400px;background-repeat:repeat-y}main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"],main#main .detail-hero{background:transparent!important}main#main .detail-hero{border-bottom:0}main#main .detail-hero.bg-grid{background-image:none}main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]+section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.7)}main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]{padding-bottom:2.25rem}main#main>section[style*="background:var(--ivory"]:not(.detail-hero+section){padding-top:2.25rem}@media (min-width:700px){main#main>section[styl