rem">Know what the land can hold before you offer.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">We check the septic, the flood map, the zoning and the road for any tract you send us.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Ask us about a tract</a></div></section></main>
