 <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Which home builder in Myrtle Beach is best?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We rank builders by homes sold, not by quality. D.R. Horton sold the most new homes in Horry County. To judge one builder, check the seven things in the last section of this page, starting with its license and its written warranty."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is D.R. Horton or Lennar bigger in Myrtle Beach?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"D.R. Horton. It sold 1,397 new homes in Horry County in those 12 months, against 967 for Lennar. Lennar's homes sold for less in the middle, about $258,000 against about $325,000."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Del Webb part of Pulte?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Del Webb is PulteGroup's brand for active adults. Pulte's count on this page includes the homes it sold at Del Webb North Myrtle Beach."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why can't I find Ryan Homes in the listings?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Few of its homes are listed in the MLS, the database brokers share. Ryan Homes sold 477 homes here in those 12 months and had 1 listed on the day we counted. We ask the builder for its homes for sale directly."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is Clayton Properties Group?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Berkshire Hathaway company that owns Mungo Homes. It is the seller on the deeds for Mungo's homes in Horry County."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a home builder need a license in South Carolina?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, for a home job over $5,000. Building without one is a misdemeanor."}}]}</script>
