+<main id="main"><div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/buyers/property-records/">Property records</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Deeds</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Horry County property records</p><h1 class="detail-h1">Horry County land records: how to search deeds, liens and plats<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">Deeds, mortgages and liens back to late 1979, free to search by name.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 14, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">The Horry County land records search is free, needs no account and takes three steps. Reading the deed itself takes a trip to Conway or a copy.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Horry County land records are free to search online at the Register of Deeds' search, with no account. Choose Name and type the last name first, like SMITH JOHN. The list shows the deeds, mortgages, liens and plats recorded under that name.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The list is online, but the papers are not. You read them in Conway, order a copy by mail from $8, or send us the address and we pull them free.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="search"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;colo