+<main id="main"><div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/buyers/property-records/">Property records</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Tax Bill</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Horry County property records</p><h1 class="detail-h1">Horry County tax payments: find your bill and pay it online<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">Search by owner name or PIN, pay by e-check for free, and do it by January 15 to avoid a penalty.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 14, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">The county's tax search needs no account. Three steps take you from an owner's name or a PIN to a paid bill.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Pay Horry County taxes online on the Treasurer's <a href="https://horrycountytreasurer.qpaybill.com/Taxes/TaxesDefaultType4.aspx" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tax Payments and Receipts site</a>, and find a bill by owner name, PIN, map number or notice number.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Paying by e-check is free, and a card costs 2.35%. The bill is due January 15; a 3% penalty starts the next day and reaches 15% on March 17.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="pay-online"