min(13rem,100%),1fr))!important}</style><style>.c3-aerial .c3ph-hero,.c3-aerial-close .c3ph-hero{max-width:720px}</style><style>main#main .hx-strip:empty{display:none}main#main .hx-strip:not(:empty)+.hx-fallback{display:none}</style><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Each place here leads on something different: the sand, the land, newer houses or a short drive. Tap what matters to you, and the list keeps only the places that fit. Each name jumps to its entry below.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">A typical house, on this page, is the one in the middle. Half the houses sold for more and half for less, or half are closer to the beach and half farther.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">If you have children, our page on <a href="/buyers/relocating/schools/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">how school zones work here</a> shows how to check the school for an address.</p><div class="c3t-pick" id="find"><div class="c3t-chips" hidden><div class="c3t-row" role="group" aria-labelledby="c3t-lab0"><span class="c3t-lab" id="c3t-lab0">Price</span><div class="c3t-set"><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="b1" aria-pressed="false">Up to $300,000</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="b2" aria-pressed="false">$300,000 to $450,000</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="b3" aria-pressed="false">Over $450,000</button></div></div><div class="c3t-row" role="group" aria-labelledby="c3t-lab1"><span class="c3t-lab" id="c3t-lab1">Must have</span><div class="c3t-set"><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="sand" aria-pressed="false">Beach in 10 minutes</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="land" aria-pressed="false">Acre lots common</button><button type="button" class="c3t-chip" data-k="new" aria-pressed="false">Builders selling now</button><button type="button"