="noopener noreferrer">crabbing</a>, <a href="https://www.myrtlebeachareacvb.com/news/myrtle-beach-lights-up-july-4th-with-fireworks-festivals-and-family-fun" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">golf cart parade</a>, <a href="https://gulfstreamcafe.com/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Gulfstream Cafe</a>, <a href="https://www.horrycountysc.gov/departments/parksandrecreation/beach-accesses/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">beach accesses</a>. Murrells Inlet: <a href="https://marshwalk.com/history/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">history</a>, <a href="https://marshwalk.com/calendar/wonderland-of-lights-on-the-marshwalk/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">lights</a>, <a href="https://www.postandcourier.com/georgetown/news/murrells-inlet-annual-july-4-boat-parade/article_37c4a398-34c5-11ef-8dbf-c31e944fd066.html" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">boat parade</a>. Pawleys Island: <a href="https://www.townofpawleysisland.com/about-pawleys-island/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">about the island</a>, <a href="https://www.scetv.org/stories/2018/ghosts-and-legends-gray-man-and-hurricanes" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">the Gray Man</a>, <a href="https://www.townofpawleysisland.com/s-c-u-t-e/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">SCUTE</a>, <a href="https://www.townofpawleysisland.com/fourth-of-july-parade/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">parade</a>, <a href="https://southcarolinaparks.com/huntington-beach" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Huntington Beach State Park</a>.</div><div class="c3ph-credits"><div class="c3ph-h" id="photo-credits">Photo credits</div><div role="list" aria-labelledby="photo-credits"><div role="listitem">Outside Loris: houses on wide lots along two country roads, with sheds, gardens and farm fields across the road. U.S. government aerial photo, 2023, by the USDA Farm Service Agency, <a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The National Map (USGS)</a>.</div><div role="listitem">Aynor from above: houses on big lots along the town's grid of streets, and farm fields and woods across the highway. U.S. government aerial photo, 2023, by the USDA Farm Service Agency, <a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The National Map (USGS)</a>.</div><div role="listitem">A new subdivision going up beside farm fields in Longs: streets and ponds dug, some houses built or framed, and most lots still empty. U.S. government aerial photo, 2023, by the USDA Farm Service Agency, <a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The National Map (USGS)</a>.</div><div role="listitem">Two of Little River's marinas share one basin off the Intracoastal Waterway, with slips sold with their own deed. U.S. government aerial photo, 2023, by the USDA Farm Service Agency, <a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/dataset/naip" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Microsoft Planetary Computer</a>. Chapter3 Realty cut this view from the NAIP image, raised the contrast a little and added labels placed from county and Census coordinates.</div><div role="listitem">An older house under a live oak, a few blocks from Main Street in Conway. Photo: Pubdog, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/mark/1.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Conway_Residential_Historic_District_Jun_10.JPG" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wikimedia Commons</a>. Chapter3 Realty blurred the house number and resized the photo.</div><div role="listitem">Houses on the dug channels at Cherry Grove, at the north end of North Myrtle Beach, from above. U.S. government aerial photo, 2023, by the USDA Farm Service Agency, <a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">USGS The National Map</a>. Chapter3 Realty exported this view from the NAIP image service, raised the contrast a little and added labels placed from OpenStreetMap, Horry County and Census coordinates.</div><div role="listitem">Houses on streets that end in cul-de-sacs in Carolina Forest, with woods around them and land being cleared for more on the right. U.S. government aerial photo, 2023, by the USDA Farm Service Agency, <a href="https://www.fsa.usda.gov/help/policies-and-links/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Public domain</a>, via <a href="https://imagery.nationalmap.gov/arcgis/rest/services/USGSNAIPImagery/ImageServer" target="_blank" rel="no