g></span><span><strong>Nursing home, shared room</strong><span class="t">$8,900 a month</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 11.5 12 3.5l9 8M5.5 10v10.5h13V10M10 20.5V15h4v5.5"/></svg></span><span><strong>Care at home</strong><span class="t">$31 an hour</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 21s-7-6.2-7-11.5a7 7 0 0 1 14 0C19 14.8 12 21 12 21z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.5"/></svg></span><span><strong>Assisted living homes</strong><span class="t">23 licensed</span></span></li></ul></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 14, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Assisted living, memory care, nursing homes and continuing care around Myrtle Beach: 2025 costs, the licensed homes town by town, and when buying still makes sense.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Assisted living around Myrtle Beach costs about $5,850 a month, about $70,200 a year. The state licenses 20 assisted living homes in Horry County and 3 more in Murrells Inlet and Pawleys Island.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">While no one needs daily care, owning costs far less: about $1,380 a year in county tax at 65 on a $400,000 house outside the city limits. Help at home costs about $31 an hour.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Tell us what care is needed. We plan the move and price the house.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Have us plan the move</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#costs" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Costs</a></li><li><a href="#choices" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The choices</a></li><li><a href="#by-town" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">By town</a></li><li><a href="#memory-care" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Memory care and nursing homes</a></li><li><a href="#continuing-care" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Continuing care</a></li><li><a href="#buying" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-dec