+<main id="main"><div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/hoa/">HOA</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Fees by neighborhood</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">HOA fees</p><h1 class="detail-h1">HOA fees in 382 Myrtle Beach area neighborhoods<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">What each one costs a month, and what you get for it.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 14, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Waterbridge has a pool complex, pocket parks and over 80 acres of lakes and natural areas. Most of its homes for sale list a $150 monthly HOA fee.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">In the middle Myrtle Beach area neighborhood of houses, the HOA fee is about $95 a month. About 6 in 10 charge $100 or less.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The fee is higher where it includes more. It is about $300 where the listings say it includes lawn care, and about $250 in the middle townhome neighborhood.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Serious about one home? We get its HOA budget and rules before you offer.</p><a cl