(--navy);text-decoration:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">12,000-square-foot clubhouse</a> and outdoor amphitheater, had fewer. Send us any name or address, and we find its HOA fee. For a home you are serious about, we get the HOA's budget, rules and any second fee.</p><a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Ask us about one neighborhood</a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="by-town"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="By town">How much are HOA fees in each town?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The middle neighborhood fee is about $72 a month in Surfside Beach and about $236 in Pawleys Island.</p><style>main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact{padding-top:1rem;padding-bottom:.85rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .cap{margin-bottom:.7rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowgroup]{gap:.5rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=row]{gap:.1rem .9rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowheader]{line-height:1.3}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .b{height:.5rem;min-width:.5rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .v{line-height:1.25}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact figcaption{margin-top:.8rem}@media (max-width:699px){main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowgroup]{gap:.45rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=row]{gap:.05rem}}</style><figure class="c3-gchart c3-gchart-compact"><div role="table" aria-label="HOA fees are highest in North Myrtle Beach and Pawleys Island"><span class="cap" aria-hidden="true">HOA fees are highest in North Myrtle Beach and Pawleys Island</span><div role="rowgroup" class="sr"><div role="row"><span role="columnheader">Town, neighborhoods in the table</span><span role="columnheader">Middle monthly HOA fee</span></div></div><div role="rowgroup"><div role="row"><span role="rowheade