ow"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">Georgetown</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">16 neighborhoods</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.529" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$125</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">Murrells Inlet</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">35 neighborhoods</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.593" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$140</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">North Myrtle Beach</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">29 neighborhoods</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.872" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$206</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">Pawleys Island</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">14 neighborhoods</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:1" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$236</span></span></div></div></div><figcaption>The middle neighborhood's monthly HOA fee in each town: half the neighborhoods charge more, half less. All kinds of homes.</figcaption></figure><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">In Myrtle Beach, the town with the most neighborhoods in the table, it is about $110.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="what-it-buys"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Most for the fee">Which neighborhoods give the most for the fee?</h2><style>main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact{padding-top:1rem;padding-bottom:.85rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .cap{margin-bottom:.7rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowgroup]{gap:.5rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=row]{gap:.1rem .9rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowheader]{line-height:1.3}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .b{height:.5rem;min-width:.5rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .v{line-height:1.25}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact figcaption{margin-top:.8rem}@media (max-width:699px){main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowgroup]{gap:.45rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=row]{gap:.05rem}}</style><figure class="c3-gchart c3-gchart-compact"><div role="table" aria-label="Most neighborhoods of houses charge $51 to $100 a month"><span class="cap" aria-hidden="true">Most neighborhoods of houses charge $51 to $100 a month</span><div role="rowgroup" class="sr"><div role="row"><span role="columnheader">Middle monthly HOA fee</span><span role="columnheader">Neighborhoods of houses</span></div></div><div role="rowgroup"><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">$50 or less</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.296" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">37</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">$51 to $100</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:1" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">125</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">$101 to $150</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.448" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">56</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">$151 to $200</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.192" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">24</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">$201 to $300</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.152" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">19</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">Over $300</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.152" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">19</span></span></div></div></div><figcaption>How many of the 280 neighborhoods of houses with a listed fee fall in each range. Each one's fee is the middle of its listings.</figcaption></figure><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Where the listings mark a pool and a clubhouse, the middle fee is about $115 a month. Where they mark neither, it is about $68.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Where the listings say the fee includes lawn care, the middle fee is about $300. Where it does not, it is about $90.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">A pool and a clubhouse for under $50 a month</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">In these neighborhoods of houses, the listings mark a pool and a clubhouse, and the middle fee is under $50:</p><ul class="hf-list"><li><strong>The Lakes</strong> in Myrtle Beach, about $25</li><li><strong>Aberdeen</strong> in Longs, about $30</li><li><strong>Long Bay</strong> in Longs, about $38</li><li><strong>Southgate</strong> in Carolina Forest, about $46</li><li><strong>Lakeside at Eagle Nest</strong> in Little River, about $48</li></ul><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Each of these rests on only a few homes for sale, so we confirm the fee with the HOA.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Fees in the 55+ communities, and what each one includes, are on our <a href="/buyers/55-plus-communities/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">55+ communities page</a>.</p><h3 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.25rem;color:var(--navy);margin:1.6rem 0 .6rem">The top of the range</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Among the highest middle fees for houses:</p><ul class="hf-list"><li><strong>North Beach Plantation's cottage neighborhoods</strong> in North Myrtle Beach, about $898 a month. The listings say the fee includes lawn care and internet.</li><li><strong>Grande Dunes - Waterside Pointe</strong> in Myrtle Beach, about $503.</li><li><strong>Prince George Ocean</strong> in Pawleys Island, about $493.</li></ul><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Each of these rests on a few homes for sale. Gated neighborhoods and what they charge are on our <a href="/buyers/gated-communities/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">gated communities page</a>.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="carolina-forest"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Carolina Forest">What are HOA fees in Carolina Forest?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Carolina Forest is 34 neighborhoods in our table, each with its own HOA fee. Its neighborhoods of houses charge about $46 to $159 a month in the middle. The listings in all but one of them mark a community pool.</p><style>main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact{padding-top:1rem;padding-bottom:.85rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .cap{margin-bottom:.7rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowgroup]{gap:.5rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=row]{gap:.1rem .9rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowheader]{line-height:1.3}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .b{height:.5rem;min-width:.5rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .v{line-height:1.25}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact figcaption{margin-top:.8rem}@media (max-width:699px){main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowgroup]{gap:.45rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=row]{gap:.05rem}}@media (max-width:699px){main#main .c3-gcha