oup" class="sr"><div role="row"><span role="columnheader">Kind of home, middle half</span><span role="columnheader">Typical fee a month</span></div></div><div role="rowgroup"><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">A house</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">the middle half pay $70 to $135</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.088" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$95</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">A townhouse</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">the middle half pay $190 to $425</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.268" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$290</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">A condo off the ocean</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">the middle half pay $410 to $685</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.476" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$515</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">A condo in an oceanfront tower</span><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span><span class="f">the middle half pay $750 to $1,185</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.87" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$940</span></span></div></div></div><figcaption>The middle monthly fee of homes for sale that list one, from our listings feed. Across all condos, it is about $650.</figcaption></figure><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Listings here give the fee by the month. Over a year, that is about $1,140 for a typical house and about $7,800 for a typical condo.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="what-fees-cover"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3