-<main id="main"><div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/invest/">Invest</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Airbnb Income</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Short-term rental income</p><h1 class="detail-h1">How much do Airbnbs make in Myrtle Beach, by town and size?<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">Most of the difference between towns is the size of the homes.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated November 12, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">What the average Grand Strand Airbnb takes in from guests in a year, by town, by home size and by month.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The average Airbnb in the Myrtle Beach area took in about $25,800 from guests in a year, cleaning fees included, before any cost. An average two-bedroom took in about $21,000 to $28,000 a year in seven of the eight Grand Strand towns. In most of them, an average four-bedroom took in about $42,000 to $73,000.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">What is left after the bills depends most on the HOA fee. Run by its owner, a typical two-bedroom Garden City Beach condo keeps about $5,000 a year before any loan. A typical oceanfront one inside Myrtle Beach keeps about $4,500 if it is open all year. Open only part of the year, at the nights the average listing books, it comes up short.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><p style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Send us a listing. We send what Airbnbs like it take in nearby.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Send us a listing</a></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory);padding-top:2.5rem"><div class="wrap"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:0;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#by-town" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">By town</a></li><li><a href="#by-size" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">By size</a></li><li><a href="#by-month" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">By month</a></li><li><a href="#managers" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Managers</a></li><li><a href="#worth-it" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Worth it?</a></li><li><a href="#myrtle-beach-airbnb-income-questions" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Myrtle Beach Airbnb income questions</a></li></ul></nav></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="by-town"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);f