px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14)!important;border-radius:28px!important;padding:2.2rem 1.6rem!important;margin-left:auto!important;margin-right:auto!important;width:calc(100% - 32px);box-sizing:border-box}@media (max-width:699px){main#main>section[style^="background:var(--navy)"]:last-of-type:not(.c3-x)>.wrap{padding:1.6rem 1.2rem 1.7rem!important;border-radius:24px!important}}@media (max-width:359px){.c3-glance{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)!important}}main#main .c3-gchart,main#main .c3-cb-tab,main#main .c3-cb-guide,main#main .c3-cb-cov{max-width:720px!important;box-sizing:border-box}</style><style>main#main .hx-strip:empty{display:none}main#main .hx-strip:not(:empty)+.hx-fallback{display:none}</style><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Pick what matters most to you. Each name goes to its building below, with its units for sale.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">A typical fee or price is the middle one: half the units pay more, and half pay less. Sale prices are from the past year.</p><ul class="c3-cb-guide" aria-label="Which building fits what you want"><li><b>Units that sold for about $100,000 or less</b><a href="#sea-mist-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Sea Mist Resort</a>, <a href="#coral-beach-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Coral Beach Resort</a>, <a href="#landmark-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Landmark Resort</a></li><li><b>A low monthly fee</b><a href="#sands-ocean-club" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Sands Ocean Club</a>, <a href="#beach-colony" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Beach Colony</a>, <a href="#sea-mist-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Sea Mist Resort</a>, <a href="#bay-watch-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Bay Watch Resort</a>, <a href="#camelot-by-the-sea" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Camelot by the Sea</a></li><li><b>Waterslides</b><a href="#compass-cove" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Compass Cove</a>, <a href="#grande-cayman-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Grande Cayman Resort</a>, <a href="#ocean-reef-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Ocean Reef Resort</a>, <a href="#sand-dunes-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Sand Dunes Resort</a>, <a href="#landmark-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Landmark Resort</a> (for rental-program guests)</li><li><b>A lazy river indoors or under a roof, for any season</b><a href="#landmark-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Landmark Resort</a>, <a href="#bay-view-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Bay View Resort</a>, <a href="#caribbean-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Caribbean Resort</a>, <a href="#monterey-bay-suites" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Monterey Bay Suites</a>, <a href="#grande-cayman-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Grande Cayman Resort</a>, <a href="#ocean-reef-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Ocean Reef Resort</a>, <a href="#avista-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Avista Resort</a></li><li><b>A lazy river outside</b><a href="#compass-cove" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Compass Cove</a>, <a href="#beach-colony" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Beach Colony</a>, <a href="#sand-dunes-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Sand Dunes Resort</a>, <a href="#seawatch-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">SeaWatch Resort</a>, <a href="#north-beach-towers" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">North Beach Towers</a>, <a href="#beach-cove-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Beach Cove Resort</a>, <a href="#bay-watch-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Bay Watch Resort</a>, <a href="#prince-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Prince Resort</a>, on the roof</li><li><b>Near the Boardwalk and the SkyWheel</b><a href="#bay-view-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Bay View Resort</a>, <a href="#camelot-by-the-sea" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Camelot by the Sea</a></li><li><b>Next to a fishing pier</b><a href="#prince-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Prince Resort</a>, at the Cherry Grove Pier</li><li><b>Mostly two and three bedrooms</b><a href="#dunes-village-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Dunes Village Resort</a>, <a href="#sand-dunes-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Sand Dunes Resort</a>, <a href="#margate-tower" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Margate Tower</a>, <a href="#brighton-tower" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Brighton Tower</a>, <a href="#south-hampton" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">South Hampton</a>, <a href="#royale-palms" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Royale Palms</a>, <a href="#north-beach-towers" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">North Beach Towers</a></li><li><b>Pets allowed on most listings</b><a href="#beach-colony" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Beach Colony</a>, <a href="#margate-tower" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Margate Tower</a>, <a href="#brighton-tower" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Brighton Tower</a>, <a href="#royale-palms" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Royale Palms</a>, <a href="#north-beach-towers" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">North Beach Towers</a>, <a href="#ocean-creek-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Ocean Creek Resort</a></li><li><b>Behind a gate</b><a href="#ocean-creek-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Ocean Creek Resort</a>, <a href="#seawatch-resort" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">SeaWatch Resort</a></li></ul></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="myrtle-beach"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Myrtle Beach">What are the oceanfront condo buildings in Myrtle Beach?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem"><a href="/submarkets/myrtle-beach/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Myrtle Beach</a>'s oceanfront buildings run from Myrtle Beach Resort, south of the state park, past the Boardwalk and the SkyWheel, north to SeaWatch Resort near the Tanger Outlets.</p><style>.c3ph-f{position:relative;margin:0;border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--ivory-2)}.c3ph-f img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:cover}.c3ph-cr{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:0;max-width:100%;padding:1.6rem .6rem .35rem 2.6rem;font:400 .625rem/1.3 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.01em;color:#fff;text-align:right;background:radial-gradient(farthest-side at 100% 100%,rgba(28,32,40,.72),rgba(28,32,40,.4) 55%,rgba(28,32,40,0));white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;pointer-events:none}.c3ph-cr a{color:#fff;text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);text-underline-offset:2px;pointer-events:auto;padding:10px 0 6px}.c3ph-hero{margin:1.6rem 0 2rem}.c3ph-hero .c3ph-f{border-radius:8px}.c3ph-hero img{aspect-ratio:4/3}@media (min-width:700px){.c3ph-hero img{aspect-ratio:16/9}}.c3ph-hero figcaption{color:var(--muted);font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.5;margin-top:.55rem}</style><figure class="c3ph-hero" style="max-width:720px;"><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/2026-11-b/invest-condo-buildings/myrtle-beach-oceanfront-towers-from-the-beach-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/2026-11-b/invest-condo-buildings/myrtle-beach-oceanfront-towers-from-the-beach-600w.webp 600w, /images/2026-11-b/invest-condo-buildings/myrtle-beach-oceanfront-towers-from-the-beach-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 720px" width="1200" height="900" alt="Tall oceanfront towers with rows of balconies behind the dune in Myrtle Beach, with more towers lined up along the beach into the distance under a blue sky" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Photo: DiscoA340. License: CC BY-SA 4.0" title="License: CC BY-SA 4.0">Photo: DiscoA340</a></span></div><figcaption>Oceanfront towers along the beach in Myrtle Beach.</figcaption></figure><h3 id="myrtle-beach-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Myrtle Beach Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Myrtle Beach Resort's Renaissance Tower stands about 236 feet tall, the southernmost tower on this page. More than a mile up the beach is Myrtle Beach State Park, with its seaside forest and fishing pier, one of the last green stretches of beachfront on the Grand Strand.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The resort has more two-bedroom units for sale than any other building here. Every listing gives the same address, so we find which tower a unit is in before you offer. The typical unit asks about $170,000, with a fee near $835 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="myrtle-beach-resort" data-name="Myrtle Beach Resort" data-head="Myrtle Beach Resort condos, a mile south of the state park's forest"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Myrtle%20Beach%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Myrtle Beach Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="compass-cove" class="c3-cb-h3">Compass Cove</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Compass Cove has 23 water features, among them three lazy rivers and two waterslides, the Schooner Screamer and the Compass Cruiser. The Crow's Nest Oceanfront Bar & Grill is on site.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It stands under a mile north of Springmaid Pier. Units here change hands often: only three buildings on this page had more sales. Most are studios and one-bedrooms, and they sold for about $149,000, with fees near $960 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="compass-cove" data-name="Compass Cove" data-head="Oceanfront condos at Compass Cove, with 23 water features"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Compass%20Cove">Get the condos for sale at Compass Cove<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="bluewater-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Bluewater Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Bluewater has indoor pickleball and racquetball courts, so you can play all year. It stands about halfway between Springmaid Pier and Family Kingdom's rides, a little over a mile from each.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It is mostly one-bedrooms, and most list the same fee, about $905 a month. Its sales in the past year had a typical price of about $94,000. Its name covers more than one kind of unit, so we price a Bluewater unit from sales of units like it.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="bluewater-resort" data-name="Bluewater Resort" data-head="Oceanfront condos at Bluewater Resort, with indoor pickleball"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Bluewater%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Bluewater Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="the-palace" class="c3-cb-h3">The Palace</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The Palace stands 241 feet tall. It has two beach accesses and a putting green next to its oceanfront pools, and its guests get two free passes a day to the H2Oasis water park at Landmark, in season.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It stands beside Landmark Resort. Its units for sale are studios, one-bedrooms and two-bedrooms in about equal numbers. A typical unit sold for about $142,000, with a typical fee of about $685 a month.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">For its fee by unit size and the units that sold, see <a href="/invest/condo-buildings/palace-resort/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Palace Resort condos for sale</a>.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="the-palace" data-name="The Palace" data-head="Condos in the Palace, a 241-foot tower on the ocean"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=The%20Palace">Get the condos for sale at The Palace<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="landmark-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Landmark Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Landmark has 17 water features. Its 300-foot indoor lazy river is heated and open all year, and a second one runs outside in season. Its water park, H2Oasis, has three slides, for guests who stay through the resort's own rental program.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It is the biggest building on this page, with 571 units, and it has more for sale this week than any other. Family Kingdom's rides are under a mile north. Every unit for sale is a studio or a one-bedroom. They sold for about $100,000, with a typical fee near $905 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="landmark-resort" data-name="Landmark Resort" data-head="Oceanfront condos at Landmark Resort, home of the H2Oasis water park"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Landmark%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Landmark Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="sea-mist-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Sea Mist Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Sea Mist Resort is where an oceanfront condo costs the least: a typical unit sold for about $53,000, the lowest here.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Family Kingdom's rides are about half a mile north, and the 2nd Avenue Pier at the Boardwalk's south end is under a mile away. Every unit for sale this week is a studio, asking about $70,000, with a fee near $610 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="sea-mist-resort" data-name="Sea Mist Resort" data-head="The lowest-priced oceanfront condos on this page: Sea Mist Resort"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Sea%20Mist%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Sea Mist Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="coral-beach-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Coral Beach Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Coral Beach Resort stands beside Sea Mist, on its north side, and its units sold for about $86,000, the second lowest here. Only two buildings had more sales.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Most of its 40 units for sale are one-bedrooms, and the typical fee is about $1,345 a month. That is a high fee for the price, so we get the building's budget before you offer, to see what it pays for.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="coral-beach-resort" data-name="Coral Beach Resort" data-head="Oceanfront condos at Coral Beach, among the lowest-priced here"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Coral%20Beach%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Coral Beach Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="bay-view-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Bay View Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Bay View sits right in front of the Boardwalk, and Starbucks is on the ground floor of the tower. The 2nd Avenue Pier is about a third of a mile south, and the SkyWheel is about half a mile north.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Inside are a heated pool and a heated lazy river. Most units for sale are one-bedrooms. They sold for about $188,000, and the typical fee is about $780 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="bay-view-resort" data-name="Bay View Resort" data-head="Condos at Bay View, right on the Myrtle Beach Boardwalk"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Bay%20View%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Bay View Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="camelot-by-the-sea" class="c3-cb-h3">Camelot by the Sea</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">From Camelot by the Sea, the Boardwalk's north end at Pier 14 is about a ten-minute walk, and the SkyWheel is about half a mile away.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It charges one of the lowest fees on the oceanfront, about $625 a month, and its units, from studios to three bedrooms, sold for about $220,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="camelot-by-the-sea" data-name="Camelot by the Sea" data-head="Oceanfront condos at Camelot by the Sea, a walk from the Boardwalk"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Camelot%20by%20the%20Sea">Get the condos for sale at Camelot by the Sea<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="caribbean-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Caribbean Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The Caribbean has a lazy river outside and a second one indoors. Beside it is the restaurant Sea Captain's House, which began as an oceanfront beach cottage built in 1930.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Its units run from one-bedrooms to four bedrooms, the widest spread of fees on this page: a larger unit pays a much larger fee. A Caribbean unit sold for about $215,000, with a typical fee of about $1,395 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="caribbean-resort" data-name="Caribbean Resort" data-head="Oceanfront condos at the Caribbean, beside Sea Captain's House"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Caribbean%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Caribbean Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="beach-colony" class="c3-cb-h3">Beach Colony</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Between Beach Colony's pool deck and the sand is an oceanfront lawn with hammocks. There is a lazy river too, with indoor and outdoor pools.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It stands next to Dunes Village and has one of the lowest fees here, about $595 a month. Almost every unit for sale allows pets. Most are one- and two-bedrooms; they sold for about $225,000, and the typical one asks about $220,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="beach-colony" data-name="Beach Colony" data-head="Beach Colony condos, with a lawn and hammocks by the sand"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Beach%20Colony">Get the condos for sale at Beach Colony<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="dunes-village-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Dunes Village Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Dunes Village Resort has room for a big group: most of its units for sale have two bedrooms or more, up to four bedrooms, and the building has an indoor pool. It stands next to Beach Colony.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Only Margate Tower charges more: the typical fee here is about $1,690 a month. Dunes Village units sold for about $300,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="dunes-village-resort" data-name="Dunes Village Resort" data-head="Big oceanfront condos at Dunes Village: most have two bedrooms or more"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Dunes%20Village%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Dunes Village Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="monterey-bay-suites" class="c3-cb-h3">Monterey Bay Suites</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Monterey Bay Suites has a pool on its roof, with a view of the Myrtle Beach skyline. Downstairs, the indoor pool opens into the outdoor pool, so you can swim out into the sun. There is an indoor lazy river too.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Every unit for sale is a one-bedroom. About one in ten of its units sold in the past year, for about $150,000, and the typical fee is about $940 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="monterey-bay-suites" data-name="Monterey Bay Suites" data-head="Oceanfront condos at Monterey Bay Suites, with a rooftop pool"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Monterey%20Bay%20Suites">Get the condos for sale at Monterey Bay Suites<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="grande-cayman-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Grande Cayman Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Grande Cayman has 720 feet of beach on the north end of Myrtle Beach, and a waterslide three stories tall, open in season. Its lazy river is under a roof, so you can float it all year.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It was once called Long Bay Resort. Units for sale are mostly studios and one-bedrooms, with a few of three bedrooms. The typical fee is about $750 a month, and units sold for about $170,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="grande-cayman-resort" data-name="Grande Cayman Resort" data-head="Oceanfront condos at Grande Cayman, with 720 feet of beach"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Grande%20Cayman%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Grande Cayman Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="caravelle-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Caravelle Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The Caravelle's pool deck is a full block long, from the beach to Ocean Boulevard. In the main Caravelle building, the indoor pool is on the seventh floor, behind floor-to-ceiling windows.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It has been a Myrtle Beach resort since 1960, mostly studios and one-bedrooms. One of its nine buildings, Sea Mark Tower, is on HUD's list of condos approved for FHA loans, and its units are listed under their own name. Only seven buildings had more sales. Units sold for about $140,000, with a typical fee of about $750 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="caravelle-resort" data-name="Caravelle Resort" data-head="Oceanfront condos at The Caravelle, with a block-long pool deck"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Caravelle%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Caravelle Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="ocean-reef-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Ocean Reef Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Ocean Reef completed a renovation of more than $15 million. Children get the Shipwreck Water Park, with giant tiki men, a sinking ship and a waterslide, and there is an indoor lazy river for a rainy day.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">About half its units for sale are studios, and a few have three bedrooms or more, so the fees spread wide. The typical fee is about $940 a month, and a quarter of the units for sale pay about $1,740 or more. Units sold for about $124,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="ocean-reef-resort" data-name="Ocean Reef Resort" data-head="Oceanfront condos at Ocean Reef, home of the Shipwreck Water Park"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Ocean%20Reef%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Ocean Reef Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="sand-dunes-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Sand Dunes Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Sand Dunes has a 130,000-gallon water park on its grounds, an oceanfront lazy river and a blacklight indoor mini golf course. The resort's suites, condos and villas fill eight buildings, some on the sand and some across the street.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It has more three-bedroom units for sale than any other building here, and studios too, so its fees range widely; the typical one is about $1,245 a month. It had among the most sales of any building, at a typical price of about $270,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="sand-dunes-resort" data-name="Sand Dunes Resort" data-head="Sand Dunes condos with a 130,000-gallon water park on the grounds"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Sand%20Dunes%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Sand Dunes Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="sands-ocean-club" class="c3-cb-h3">Sands Ocean Club</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Sands Ocean Club sits on Shore Drive, under a quarter mile from the Dunes Golf and Beach Club, a private club since 1948. The club's course hosted the PGA Tour's 2026 Myrtle Beach Classic.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It has the lowest fee on this page, about $425 a month. Most of its units for sale are studios, and a studio's fee is smaller. It is a large resort of at least 491 units, and a unit here sold for about $138,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="sands-ocean-club" data-name="Sands Ocean Club" data-head="Sands Ocean Club condos, near the course that hosted the PGA Tour"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Sands%20Ocean%20Club">Get the condos for sale at Sands Ocean Club<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 class="c3-cb-lead" id="kingston-plantation">Kingston Plantation</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The next three towers stand in Kingston Plantation. Kingston Resorts counts more than half a mile of beach on its grounds, and 157 acres built around trees, with lakes beside its lodges and villas. Families have stayed here since the 1960s, when it was a campground called Lake Arrowhead, and the Arcadian Shores golf course is across the street. Each tower has its own fee.</p><h3 id="margate-tower" class="c3-cb-h3">Margate Tower</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Margate Tower rises about 330 feet, the tallest building in Myrtle Beach. Its units climb to the 29th floor.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It has the largest units on this page too: every unit for sale has three or four bedrooms, and the typical one has about 2,400 square feet. Its fee is the highest here, about $1,820 a month, and so are its sale prices, about $950,000. Every unit for sale allows pets.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="margate-tower" data-name="Margate Tower" data-head="Condos in Margate Tower, the tallest building in Myrtle Beach"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Margate%20Tower">Get the condos for sale at Margate Tower<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="brighton-tower" class="c3-cb-h3">Brighton Tower</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Brighton's units climb to the 21st floor, over Kingston's half mile of beach. It has the lowest fee of the three Kingston towers, about $1,075 a month.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Each unit for sale has two or three bedrooms. They sold for about $580,000, and the typical one for sale asks about $650,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="brighton-tower" data-name="Brighton Tower" data-head="Brighton Tower condos, 21 floors over Kingston Plantation's beach"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Brighton%20Tower">Get the condos for sale at Brighton Tower<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="south-hampton" class="c3-cb-h3">South Hampton</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">South Hampton stands beside the Embassy Suites, on Kingston's half mile of beach. It has 144 units, fewer than Margate or Brighton, and they sold for the least of the three, about $450,000.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">All its units for sale have two or three bedrooms, and the typical fee is about $1,305 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="south-hampton" data-name="South Hampton" data-head="South Hampton condos on Kingston Plantation's half mile of beach"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=South%20Hampton">Get the condos for sale at South Hampton<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="royale-palms" class="c3-cb-h3">Royale Palms</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Royale Palms rises about 255 feet beside the Hilton, with units up to the 24th floor. For guests who rent here, the resort lists the Hilton's sand-bottom pool and Currents Seaside Entertainment.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Most of its units for sale have three bedrooms, and the rest have two. The typical fee is about $1,600 a month, the third highest here, and units sold for about $550,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="royale-palms" data-name="Royale Palms" data-head="Royale Palms condos, 24 floors up beside the Hilton"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Royale%20Palms">Get the condos for sale at Royale Palms<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="seawatch-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">SeaWatch Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">SeaWatch has 19 water features: six oceanfront pools, two lazy rivers and ten hot tubs. In season there is a tiki bar and grill on the oceanfront, and a fire pit.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">It is a gated resort about a mile from the Tanger Outlets. Only five units are for sale this week, but 23 sold in the past year, for about $235,000. We tell you when a unit like the one you want comes up.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="seawatch-resort" data-name="SeaWatch Resort" data-head="SeaWatch condos, with 19 water features behind a gate"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=SeaWatch%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at SeaWatch Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="north-myrtle-beach"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="North Myrtle Beach">What are the oceanfront condo buildings in North Myrtle Beach?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem"><a href="/submarkets/north-myrtle-beach/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">North Myrtle Beach</a>'s oceanfront buildings run from Ocean Creek Resort, near Barefoot Landing, north to Prince Resort at the Cherry Grove Pier.</p><h3 id="ocean-creek-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Ocean Creek Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">From Ocean Creek's towers, you watch the sun go down past the dunes and a creek that rises and falls with the tide. Its 57 acres have walking and biking trails, tennis and pickleball courts, and a stretch of beach the resort calls secluded.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The gated grounds reach US 17, across the highway from Barefoot Landing. Units for sale run from studios to three bedrooms. The typical one asks about $225,000, with a fee of about $790 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="ocean-creek-resort" data-name="Ocean Creek Resort" data-head="Ocean Creek condos on 57 acres, with sunsets over a tidal creek"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Ocean%20Creek%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Ocean Creek Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="north-beach-towers" class="c3-cb-h3">North Beach Towers</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">North Beach Towers stand on a 7.5-acre island between the ocean and White Point Swash, the resort says. Around them are 2.5 acres of pools, with a lazy river, a swim-up bar and private cabanas.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Units run from one-bedrooms to four bedrooms and have the second-highest sale prices on this page, about $850,000. The typical fee is about $1,295 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="north-beach-towers" data-name="North Beach Towers" data-head="North Beach Towers condos, with a swim-up bar and 2.5 acres of pools"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=North%20Beach%20Towers">Get the condos for sale at North Beach Towers<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="beach-cove-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Beach Cove Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Every suite and condo at Beach Cove faces the ocean, the resort says. A 350-foot lazy river winds past three outdoor pools, heated in season.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Every unit for sale is a one- or two-bedroom. Units here sell often: about one in nine sold in the past year, for about $171,000. The typical fee is about $785 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="beach-cove-resort" data-name="Beach Cove Resort" data-head="Beach Cove condos, where every unit faces the ocean"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Beach%20Cove%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Beach Cove Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="bay-watch-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Bay Watch Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Bay Watch is three towers on the sand at Crescent Beach: North, Center and South. The grounds have lazy rivers, indoor and outdoor pools, and Fishtails, a bar by the pool.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">With 532 units it is one of the largest buildings here, about two and a half miles south of Main Street. Its typical fee, about $610 a month, is one of the lowest, and its units, from studios to three bedrooms, sold for about $265,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="bay-watch-resort" data-name="Bay Watch Resort" data-head="Bay Watch condos, three oceanfront towers at Crescent Beach"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Bay%20Watch%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Bay Watch Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="avista-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Avista Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Avista stands about a quarter mile from the ocean end of <a href="/submarkets/north-myrtle-beach/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Main Street</a>. The state Senate calls North Myrtle Beach the birthplace of the shag; in the 1940s, visitors came to dance at the beach music clubs on Main Street and Ocean Drive.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Its pools, lazy river and hot tubs are outdoors and indoors, so a rainy day still has a swim. Most units for sale are one-bedrooms. With a typical fee of about $840 a month, Avista units sold for about $260,000.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="avista-resort" data-name="Avista Resort" data-head="Avista condos, a quarter mile from Main Street, home of the shag"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Avista%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Avista Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><h3 id="prince-resort" class="c3-cb-h3">Prince Resort</h3><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Prince Resort has a pool and a lazy river on its roof, beside the Cherry Grove Pier. Some condos look out over the inlet instead of the ocean. It is the northernmost building on this page.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Six units sold on their own in the past year, for about $365,000. The typical fee is about $1,035 a month.</p><div class="hx-strip" data-place="prince-resort" data-name="Prince Resort" data-head="Prince Resort condos by the Cherry Grove Pier, lazy river on the roof"></div><div class="hx-fallback"><p class="c3-offer"><a class="c3-offer-pill" href="/contact/?place=Prince%20Resort">Get the condos for sale at Prince Resort<span class="c3-offer-ar" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span></a></p></div><div style="border-left:3px solid var(--brass);background:var(--ivory);padding:1.2rem 1.4rem;margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:720px"><p style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:.4rem">Before you pick a building, see its money</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.8rem">Send us the building. We get its budget and its savings for repairs, and tell you what they mean for the fee in the years ahead.</p><a class="btn btn-brass" href="/contact/">Have us pull one building's budget and reserves</a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory)" id="fees-compared"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Fees compared">How do HOA fees compare across Myrtle Beach oceanfront buildings?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">In an oceanfront building on the Grand Strand, the typical condo for sale charges about $920 a month, and half of them pay between $730 and $1,140. Our <a href="/hoa/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">HOA fees guide</a> gives the fee for every kind of home.</p><style>main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact{padding-top:1rem;padding-bottom:.85rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .cap{margin-bottom:.7rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowgroup]{gap:.5rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=row]{gap:.1rem .9rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowheader]{line-height:1.3}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .b{height:.5rem;min-width:.5rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact .v{line-height:1.25}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact figcaption{margin-top:.8rem}@media (max-width:699px){main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=rowgroup]{gap:.45rem}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-compact [role=row]{gap:.05rem}}@media (max-width:699px){main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-list [role=row]{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;column-gap:.8rem;align-items:start}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-list .b{display:none}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-list .dot{display:none}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-list .f{display:block}main#main .c3-gchart.c3-gchart-list [role=cell]{justify-content:flex-end}}</style><figure class="c3-gchart c3-gchart-compact c3-gchart-list"><div role="table" aria-label="The lowest fee is about $425 a month, the highest about $1,820"><span class="cap" aria-hidden="true">The lowest fee is about $425 a month, the highest about $1,820</span><div role="rowgroup" class="sr"><div role="row"><span role="columnheader">Building</span><span role="columnheader">Typical fee a month</span></div></div><div role="rowgroup"><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n"><a href="#sands-ocean-club">Sands Ocean Club</a></span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.234" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$425</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n"><a href="#every-building">Towers on the Grove</a></span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.275" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$500</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n"><a href="#every-building">Anderson Ocean Club</a></span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.313" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$570</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n"><a href="#beach-colony">Beach Colony</a></span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.327" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$595</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n"><a href="#sea-mist-resort">Sea Mist Resort</a></span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.335" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$610</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n"><a href="#bay-watch-resort">Bay Watch Resort</a></span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.335" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$610</span></span></div><div role="row" class="ref"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n">All oceanfront condos for sale</span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.505" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$920</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n"><a href="#coral-beach-resort">Coral Beach Resort</a></span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.739" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$1,345</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n"><a href="#caribbean-resort">Caribbean Resort</a></span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.766" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$1,395</span></span></div><div role="row"><span role="rowheader"><span class="n"><a href="#royale-palms">Royale Palms</a></span></span><span role="cell"><span class="b" style="--f:0.879" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="v">$1,600</span></span></div><div rol