+## Is Myrtle Beach or Charleston better to live in?
+Pick Myrtle Beach for more home, the beach and a lower tax bill. Pick Charleston for a bigger job market, more flights and its history.
+If you want Choose Why
+More home for the same money Myrtle Beach The typical home costs about a fifth less.
+A lower yearly property tax Myrtle Beach The middle bill is about $750 a year less.
