r;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Book a showing in The Farm.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">Tell us your price range and the days you can visit. We will look for the homes for sale that fit and set up showings for the ones you choose.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Book a showing in The Farm</a></div></section></main>
