 homes outlined in orange beside a lake, a dot labelled Valor Park at the edge of the shops, and ball fields and a lake labelled Grand Park","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"NOAA National Geodetic Survey"},"creditText":"NOAA National Geodetic Survey, public domain","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (NOAA National Geodetic Survey)","license":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/USCODE-2023-title17/html/USCODE-2023-title17-chap1-sec105.htm","acquireLicensePage":"https://noaa-eri-pds.s3.amazonaws.com/index.html#2026_Pre_Event/EC2601a_OB_N_RGB/","isBasedOn":"https://noaa-eri-pds.s3.amazonaws.com/index.html#2026_Pre_Event/EC2601a_OB_N_RGB/","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"The Market Common, Myrtle Beach, South Carolina"},"representativeOfPage":true},{"@type":"ImageObject","contentUrl":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/submarkets-myrtle-beach/oceanfront-houses-from-the-ocean-1200w.webp","url":"https://chapter3realty.com/images/2026-11-a/submarkets-myrtle-beach/oceanfront-houses-from-the-ocean-1200w.webp","width":1200,"height":782,"encodingFormat":"image/webp","name":"Houses on wide lawns facing the beach, on the older streets north of downtown Myrtle Beach","caption":"Houses on wide lawns facing the beach, on the older streets north of downtown Myrtle Beach.","description":"Two-story houses on wide green lawns behind the dunes, with wooden walkways to the beach and oak trees behind, seen from a plane over the ocean in Myrtle Beach","creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"U.S. Geological Survey"},"creditText":"U.S","copyrightNotice":"Public domain (U.S. Geological Survey)","license":"https://www.usa.gov/publicdomain/label/1.0/","acquireLicensePage":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","isBasedOn":"https://doi.org/10.5066/F7N877XX","contentLocation":{"@type":"Place","name":"The oceanfront, Myrtle Beach, South Carolina"},"representativeOfPage":true}]}</script></div></section><section style="background:var(--navy);padding:3rem 0"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--ivory);margin-bottom:1rem">Send us an address or a building.</h2><p style="color:rgba(244,239,232,.75);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.6rem">We tell you its zone, its HOA's rules on rentals, its HOA fee and its flood zone. Then we send you the homes for sale that fit your plan.</p><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/?place=Myrtle%20Beach">Send us a Myrtle Beach address</a></div></section></main>
